flowchart TD
  Product[Product requirements] --> Architecture[System architecture]
  Architecture --> Contracts[API and event contracts]
  Contracts --> Implementation[Frontend / Backend / Integrations]
  Implementation --> Data[Data stores and pipelines]
  Implementation --> Quality[QA and specialist verification]
  Quality --> Release[Release and operations]
  Implementation --> Docs[Technical documentation]
  Architecture --> Docs
  Docs --> Obsidian[Obsidian knowledge vault]
  Docs --> Graph[Graphify relationship graph]
  Docs --> Report[Central HTML report]
  Obsidian <--> Graph
  Graph --> Report

  Prompt[Top-level task] --> RoleSelect[Dynamic role selection]
  RoleSelect --> RoleSkills[Load selected canonical skills]
  RoleSkills --> TaskWork[Execute and verify work]
  TaskWork --> Completion[Terminal task outcome]
  Completion --> TaskReport[JSON + Markdown completion report]
  TaskReport --> Report[Central HTML report]
  Ingress[Untrusted webhook ingress] --> SecurityLog[Sanitized ingress security log]

  subgraph CopilotRuntime[VS Code Copilot runtime]
    CanonicalSkills[Canonical skills/ tree] --> SkillSync[Skill synchronizer]
    SkillSync --> CopilotSkills[.github/skills/ project discovery]
    PromptSubmit[User prompt submitted] --> PromptState[Capture execution ID and start time]
    AgentStop[Copilot agentStop hook] --> PendingReport[Require pending structured report]
    PendingReport --> ReportValidator[Validate and publish report]
  end
